# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Roua Trading (رؤى) — Environment Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# ⚠️ NEVER commit real secrets to this file!
# ⚠️ Replace ALL placeholder values with your own credentials.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Database ──
# Local dev (SQLite):
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
# Docker / Production (PostgreSQL + pgvector):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:YOUR_DB_PASSWORD@postgres:5432/roua_trading"
DB_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME

# ── Redis ──
REDIS_URL=redis://:YOUR_REDIS_PASSWORD@localhost:6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME

# ── RabbitMQ ──
RABBITMQ_URL=amqp://roua:YOUR_RABBITMQ_PASSWORD@localhost:5672
RABBITMQ_USER=roua
RABBITMQ_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME

# ── Encryption (AES-256-GCM for API keys) ──
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# ⚠️ CRITICAL: Set this in production! Without it, exchange API keys
# cannot be securely encrypted. Do NOT use NEXTAUTH_SECRET as fallback.
ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# ── AI API Keys (Fill in your keys) ──
GOOGLE_AI_STUDIO_API_KEY=     # Gemini 2.0 Flash
GROQ_API_KEY=                 # Llama 3.3 70B via Groq
GLM_API_KEY=                  # GLM-4 via Zhipu AI
HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=          # Mistral-7B + Phi-3 + Llama-3 (FREE!)
OLLAMA_API_KEY=               # Self-hosted models (Qwen2.5, Llama3, Mistral)
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=            # AWS Bedrock (Claude 3.5, Llama 3.1, Mistral, Titan)
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_REGION=us-east-1

# ── Market Data ──
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=
FINNHUB_API_KEY=

# ── CMS ──
STRAPI_URL=
STRAPI_API_KEY=

# ── WebAuthn (Passkeys) ──
RP_ID=localhost
RP_NAME=Roua Trading
ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# ── Application ──
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=CHANGE_ME_TO_A_RANDOM_SECRET
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Google OAuth ──
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ── Frontend URLs ──
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001

# ── ربط موقع الأخبار المالي ──
NEWS_SITE_URL=https://rouatradingnews-production.up.railway.app
NEWS_API_KEY=CHANGE_ME
CRON_SECRET=CHANGE_ME

# ── Admin Panel ──
ADMIN_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_TO_A_STRONG_PASSWORD

# ── Autonomous Trader Agent ──
AUTO_TRADING_ENABLED=true
DEFAULT_PAPER_BALANCE=10000
MAX_POSITION_SIZE_PERCENT=2
MAX_DAILY_LOSS_PERCENT=5
MAX_OPEN_POSITIONS=5

# ── Trading Engine Risk Parameters ──
RISK_MAX_POSITION_PERCENT=20
RISK_MAX_OPEN_POSITIONS=10
RISK_MAX_DAILY_LOSS_PERCENT=5
RISK_DEFAULT_STOP_LOSS=3
RISK_DEFAULT_TAKE_PROFIT=6
RISK_MAX_LEVERAGE=3
RISK_MIN_ORDER_SIZE=10
RISK_MAX_ORDER_SIZE=50000
RISK_CIRCUIT_BREAKER_THRESHOLD=10

# ── Paper Trading ──
PAPER_SLIPPAGE_PERCENT=0.1
PAPER_COMMISSION_PERCENT=0.1
NEXT_PUBLIC_PAPER_TRADING=false

# ── Market Data ──
DISABLE_TWELVE_DATA=false
